    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10527" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστοιχ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand opposite in rows</i> or <i>pairs,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοροὶ ἀντιστοιχοῦντες ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.4.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί</span>
			<i>stand vis-a-vis to</i> a partner in a dance, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of letters,
				<i>correspond,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰ δασέα τοῖς ψιλοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					443.17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
